{"id": "state-of-games-overseas-2026-CN", "source_key": "sensortower", "source": "sensortower.com", "section": "deep_analysis", "title": "2026年海外游戏市场洞察", "url": "https://sensortower.com/zh-CN/blog/state-of-games-overseas-2026-CN", "published_at": "2026-11-27T09:41:29", "author": "Sensor Tower", "excerpt": "", "text": "全球游戏行业正迎来深度调整与格局重塑：下载量整体持续承压，但手游内购营收、用户使用时长依旧具备较强抗跌韧性。休闲游戏营收增长势头稳固，其海外市场体量现已比肩中重度手游；解谜品类更是一跃成为海外收入最高的手游赛道。\n本报告将分析2026年海外市场移动游戏内购与广告收入趋势，洞察热门品类与子品类增长亮点，剖析热门手游创新运营活动策略，探析PC/主机游戏市场头部产品表现。请点击“下载免费报告”👇下载完整报告内容。\n全球手游内购营收与PC/主机游戏买断销售收入总额已突破1100亿美元\n2025下半年至2026上半年，全球手游、PC与主机游戏累计总下载量达480亿次。其中移动端下载量占比95.6%，依托智能手机高渗透率覆盖了海量大众用户；PC与主机端下载份额仅4.4%，但该圈层用户稳定性更高，单人付费变现效率遥遥领先，是沉淀核心用户、深挖长线收益、塑造游戏品牌影响力的关键阵地。\n同一统计周期内，全球手游内购营收与PC/主机端买断制游戏销售收入突破1100亿美元。其中移动端内购收入为809亿美元，依旧牢牢占据整体营收主场；伴随行业发展日趋成熟，手游营收增速逐步放缓、整体走向平稳。PC与主机游戏销售收入持续攀升，近一年创收296亿美元，彰显了该赛道强劲的市场抗周期韧性。\n放眼海外市场，2025下半年手游内购收入攀升至352亿美元，创下历史峰值。步入2026上半年，受多款头部产品步入运营调整期影响，海外手游内购收入小幅回落，环比下降6%至331亿美元。\n获客端下行压力仍在延续：海外手游整体下载规模持续收缩，2026上半年环比下滑4%，总量为222亿次。不过市场整体展现出鲜明的结构性韧性，海外用户手游游玩总时长始终维持稳定水平。\n解谜游戏成为海外收入规模第一的手游品类，二合子品类增长最突出\n解谜手游增长动能持续兑现：2026上半年其海外内购收入环比提升7%，达79亿美元，创下历史最高纪录，正式反超策略手游，成为海外收入规模第一的手游品类。\n策略手游于2025下半年创下84亿美元的海外营收峰值；本周期环比回落12%，主要由于头部大作经历此前一轮爆发式增长后，整体步入阶段性平稳调整期。\n休闲赛道抗周期属性凸显，市场韧性十足。2026上半年海外总收入逼近150亿美元，仅有小幅波动；现阶段海外营收体量已几乎追平中重度手游。\n混合休闲品类增长势头最为迅猛，本期海外营收环比大涨18%至22亿美元。休闲基底融合多元玩法、搭配复合变现体系，成为当下手游行业热门增长范式。\n聚焦手游细分赛道，4X策略依旧是海外收入体量最高的细分品类，2026上半年海外收入规模接近50亿美元。二合赛道本期增收超5亿美元，以37%的环比涨幅，登顶本期海外手游细分赛道增速榜。\n排序解谜赛道同样迎来爆发式增长，海外营收环比暴涨130%，营收增量达3.2亿美元。受益于《明日方舟：终末地》和《异环》等多款重磅新作集中上线，开放世界冒险手游海外收入环比大幅攀升70%，增收2亿美元，营收增量位列全细分赛道第三位。\n全球19个核心市场近一年手游广告变现收入突破110亿美元\n2025下半年至2026上半年，基于 Sensor Tower 纳入广告变现监测的全球19大核心市场统计：手游整体广告变现总收入突破110亿美元，整体平均 eCPM（千次有效展示收益）约51美元。\nAppLovin与AdMob两大广告平台合计包揽手游广告变现总收入的六成以上。分区域来看：美国市场内，AppLovin广告营收份额高达41%；而韩国、印度及东南亚各区域，AdMob广告收入占比均突破40%。\n2026上半年，在 Sensor Tower 覆盖广告变现数据的全球19个核心市场中，方块解谜超休闲手游《Block Blast!》以1.5亿美元广告收入，位列广告变现冠军，近1年月平均广告变现收入接近2600万美元。\nSteam平台买断制游戏销售收入近年快速攀升，平均单次下载收入强势领先\n在全球手游整体营收逐步企稳的大背景下，Steam平台买断制游戏销售收入迎来高速增长：营收规模由2019年的45.5亿美元攀升至2025H2—2026H1统计周期内的107亿美元。平台单次下载平均收益长期稳居高位，近五年均值达14美元，是移动端游戏的9.3倍。以上数据充分印证，跨平台产品对全球玩家始终具备强劲吸引力。\n2026上半年，动作品类牢牢占据 Steam 营收榜首。该品类整体销量虽环比回落7%，但买断营收逆势上行13%，规模升至20.2亿美元，包揽平台总收入的40%。依托一众3A大作带来的付费溢价空间，动作游戏营收实现逆势增长，是Steam最核心的收入基本盘。\n高频率、多层次并行的运营活动体系有效拉升游戏收入与长线留存\n2026上半年，海外内购收入排名前八的头部手游，每月平均上线运营活动多达235场；单款游戏月均开设56个不同主题活动，囊括29类活动类别。\n多层级、多活动并行的高频运营体系，能够长效拉动游戏流水与用户留存。2026上半年，融合解谜探案、小镇建造双玩法的合成手游《Mystery Town》，ARPDAU达1.3美元，分别为竞品《Merge Mansion》的4.6倍、《Travel Town》的5.2倍。密集多元的运营活动，搭配复合变现架构，是其达成超高变现效率的核心支撑。\nSensor Tower Playliner 运营活动洞察显示，2026年6月该游戏推出的活动多达237场，包含63款不同名称的活动(一个月内多次上线的相同名称的活动仅统计为1款)。得益于这套高效运营策略，2026年5月《Mystery Town》内购营收逼近1500万美元，规模已超越《Merge Mansion》。\n头部游戏持续进行运营活动创新。《Whiteout Survival》全新抽卡活动“Dead Shot”，创新融合带有“策略感”的开箱机制和灵活的倍数投注模式，极大地激发玩家参与度与消费热情，活动收益增幅高达71%。\n《Last War:Survival》推出的“Meteorite Iron War(陨星铁)”活动，在经典锦标赛中进行多维度创新。这款跨服锦标赛使用了“极度时间压缩+免费高频传送+零真实战损”的组合策略，大幅降低玩家参与门槛和战损焦虑，并让SLG游戏具备了电竞比赛的单局爽感。开发团队同时巧妙引入类似《逃离塔科夫》的“高风险战利品掠夺 + 安全箱保底”机制，既保证了重度PvP玩家之间充满张力的“猎杀与夺宝”体验，又通过保底机制保护了普通玩家的参与收益。活动的红黄区”风险隔离设计，通过“收益与风险杠杆”让玩家进行自我筛选，构建了一个极其健康的局内生态。\n想要了解更多相关情报，请点击以下按钮，下载完整的报告内容！\n下载免费报告\nSensor Tower 提供移动应用、网站、数字广告和受众洞察，助您了解不断变化的市场动态，超越竞争对手，并推动业务增长。欢迎联系我们，申请产品演示：\nSensor Tower\nSensor Tower Video Game Insights - PC/Console游戏数据洞察\nSensor Tower Playliner - 运营活动洞察平台 (Live Ops Insights)\nSensor Tower Web Insights - 网站洞察\nSensor Tower Pathmatics - 数字广告洞察\nSensor Tower Audience Insights - 受众洞察\n本文由 Sensor Tower 亚太地区高级分析师 Rui Ma 撰写，亚太营销副总裁 Nan Lu 授权，提供转载请注明来源Sensor Tower。\nSensor Tower - 您的数字经济情报指南。\n媒体合作 press-apac@sensortower.com\n商务合作 sales@sensortower.com\n转载请注明来源：Sensor Tower", "html": "<div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root\" data-testid=\"Text-root\"><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">全球游戏行业正迎来深度调整与格局重塑：下载量整体持续承压，但手游内购营收、用户使用时长依旧具备较强抗跌韧性。休闲游戏营收增长势头稳固，其海外市场体量现已比肩中重度手游；解谜品类更是一跃成为海外收入最高的手游赛道。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">本报告将分析2026年海外市场移动游戏内购与广告收入趋势，洞察热门品类与子品类增长亮点，剖析热门手游创新运营活动策略，探析PC/主机游戏市场头部产品表现。请点击“下载免费报告”👇下载完整报告内容。</p><br/><h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm\" data-testid=\"Text-h3\"><b>全球手游内购营收与PC/主机游戏买断销售收入总额已突破1100亿美元</b></h3><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">2025下半年至2026上半年，全球手游、PC与主机游戏累计总下载量达480亿次。其中移动端下载量占比95.6%，依托智能手机高渗透率覆盖了海量大众用户；PC与主机端下载份额仅4.4%，但该圈层用户稳定性更高，单人付费变现效率遥遥领先，是沉淀核心用户、深挖长线收益、塑造游戏品牌影响力的关键阵地。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">同一统计周期内，全球手游内购营收与PC/主机端买断制游戏销售收入突破1100亿美元。其中移动端内购收入为809亿美元，依旧牢牢占据整体营收主场；伴随行业发展日趋成熟，手游营收增速逐步放缓、整体走向平稳。PC与主机游戏销售收入持续攀升，近一年创收296亿美元，彰显了该赛道强劲的市场抗周期韧性。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.010\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.010\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2wZHVCd6KWoO7MNbP2lP5H/9fd8ba9e4cac8a171e27bf2cb47284f4/d41b1812-c685-4950-b988-93c8d4efa8a9.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2wZHVCd6KWoO7MNbP2lP5H/9fd8ba9e4cac8a171e27bf2cb47284f4/d41b1812-c685-4950-b988-93c8d4efa8a9.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2wZHVCd6KWoO7MNbP2lP5H/9fd8ba9e4cac8a171e27bf2cb47284f4/d41b1812-c685-4950-b988-93c8d4efa8a9.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2wZHVCd6KWoO7MNbP2lP5H/9fd8ba9e4cac8a171e27bf2cb47284f4/d41b1812-c685-4950-b988-93c8d4efa8a9.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2wZHVCd6KWoO7MNbP2lP5H/9fd8ba9e4cac8a171e27bf2cb47284f4/d41b1812-c685-4950-b988-93c8d4efa8a9.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2wZHVCd6KWoO7MNbP2lP5H/9fd8ba9e4cac8a171e27bf2cb47284f4/d41b1812-c685-4950-b988-93c8d4efa8a9.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2wZHVCd6KWoO7MNbP2lP5H/9fd8ba9e4cac8a171e27bf2cb47284f4/d41b1812-c685-4950-b988-93c8d4efa8a9.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2wZHVCd6KWoO7MNbP2lP5H/9fd8ba9e4cac8a171e27bf2cb47284f4/d41b1812-c685-4950-b988-93c8d4efa8a9.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2wZHVCd6KWoO7MNbP2lP5H/9fd8ba9e4cac8a171e27bf2cb47284f4/d41b1812-c685-4950-b988-93c8d4efa8a9.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2wZHVCd6KWoO7MNbP2lP5H/9fd8ba9e4cac8a171e27bf2cb47284f4/d41b1812-c685-4950-b988-93c8d4efa8a9.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">放眼海外市场，2025下半年手游内购收入攀升至352亿美元，创下历史峰值。步入2026上半年，受多款头部产品步入运营调整期影响，海外手游内购收入小幅回落，环比下降6%至331亿美元。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">获客端下行压力仍在延续：海外手游整体下载规模持续收缩，2026上半年环比下滑4%，总量为222亿次。不过市场整体展现出鲜明的结构性韧性，海外用户手游游玩总时长始终维持稳定水平。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.011\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.011\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HGAutfBkGKYVtrvLwBCbJ/6be783cb811f3cb5316dc55679a64f1b/bb7576df-f4d5-4908-ab5e-3f37b6131981.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HGAutfBkGKYVtrvLwBCbJ/6be783cb811f3cb5316dc55679a64f1b/bb7576df-f4d5-4908-ab5e-3f37b6131981.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HGAutfBkGKYVtrvLwBCbJ/6be783cb811f3cb5316dc55679a64f1b/bb7576df-f4d5-4908-ab5e-3f37b6131981.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HGAutfBkGKYVtrvLwBCbJ/6be783cb811f3cb5316dc55679a64f1b/bb7576df-f4d5-4908-ab5e-3f37b6131981.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HGAutfBkGKYVtrvLwBCbJ/6be783cb811f3cb5316dc55679a64f1b/bb7576df-f4d5-4908-ab5e-3f37b6131981.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HGAutfBkGKYVtrvLwBCbJ/6be783cb811f3cb5316dc55679a64f1b/bb7576df-f4d5-4908-ab5e-3f37b6131981.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HGAutfBkGKYVtrvLwBCbJ/6be783cb811f3cb5316dc55679a64f1b/bb7576df-f4d5-4908-ab5e-3f37b6131981.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HGAutfBkGKYVtrvLwBCbJ/6be783cb811f3cb5316dc55679a64f1b/bb7576df-f4d5-4908-ab5e-3f37b6131981.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HGAutfBkGKYVtrvLwBCbJ/6be783cb811f3cb5316dc55679a64f1b/bb7576df-f4d5-4908-ab5e-3f37b6131981.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HGAutfBkGKYVtrvLwBCbJ/6be783cb811f3cb5316dc55679a64f1b/bb7576df-f4d5-4908-ab5e-3f37b6131981.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm\" data-testid=\"Text-h3\">\n\n<b>解谜游戏成为海外收入规模第一的手游品类，二合子品类增长最突出</b></h3><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">解谜手游增长动能持续兑现：2026上半年其海外内购收入环比提升7%，达79亿美元，创下历史最高纪录，正式反超策略手游，成为海外收入规模第一的手游品类。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">策略手游于2025下半年创下84亿美元的海外营收峰值；本周期环比回落12%，主要由于头部大作经历此前一轮爆发式增长后，整体步入阶段性平稳调整期。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">休闲赛道抗周期属性凸显，市场韧性十足。2026上半年海外总收入逼近150亿美元，仅有小幅波动；现阶段海外营收体量已几乎追平中重度手游。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">混合休闲品类增长势头最为迅猛，本期海外营收环比大涨18%至22亿美元。休闲基底融合多元玩法、搭配复合变现体系，成为当下手游行业热门增长范式。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.012\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.012\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4x4zFBFEwVJxljaVOA5IrB/2f1250fd0e5734ec559a3e34e0064b93/c92cf4dd-68c5-4ca9-b467-2a6ea05c79de.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4x4zFBFEwVJxljaVOA5IrB/2f1250fd0e5734ec559a3e34e0064b93/c92cf4dd-68c5-4ca9-b467-2a6ea05c79de.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4x4zFBFEwVJxljaVOA5IrB/2f1250fd0e5734ec559a3e34e0064b93/c92cf4dd-68c5-4ca9-b467-2a6ea05c79de.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4x4zFBFEwVJxljaVOA5IrB/2f1250fd0e5734ec559a3e34e0064b93/c92cf4dd-68c5-4ca9-b467-2a6ea05c79de.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4x4zFBFEwVJxljaVOA5IrB/2f1250fd0e5734ec559a3e34e0064b93/c92cf4dd-68c5-4ca9-b467-2a6ea05c79de.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4x4zFBFEwVJxljaVOA5IrB/2f1250fd0e5734ec559a3e34e0064b93/c92cf4dd-68c5-4ca9-b467-2a6ea05c79de.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4x4zFBFEwVJxljaVOA5IrB/2f1250fd0e5734ec559a3e34e0064b93/c92cf4dd-68c5-4ca9-b467-2a6ea05c79de.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4x4zFBFEwVJxljaVOA5IrB/2f1250fd0e5734ec559a3e34e0064b93/c92cf4dd-68c5-4ca9-b467-2a6ea05c79de.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4x4zFBFEwVJxljaVOA5IrB/2f1250fd0e5734ec559a3e34e0064b93/c92cf4dd-68c5-4ca9-b467-2a6ea05c79de.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4x4zFBFEwVJxljaVOA5IrB/2f1250fd0e5734ec559a3e34e0064b93/c92cf4dd-68c5-4ca9-b467-2a6ea05c79de.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">聚焦手游细分赛道，4X策略依旧是海外收入体量最高的细分品类，2026上半年海外收入规模接近50亿美元。二合赛道本期增收超5亿美元，以37%的环比涨幅，登顶本期海外手游细分赛道增速榜。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">排序解谜赛道同样迎来爆发式增长，海外营收环比暴涨130%，营收增量达3.2亿美元。受益于《明日方舟：终末地》和《异环》等多款重磅新作集中上线，开放世界冒险手游海外收入环比大幅攀升70%，增收2亿美元，营收增量位列全细分赛道第三位。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.013\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.013\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/mGfkrmIeY6HH1v2lulpSH/120118694943aba6c98e6680d29b1abb/c7d7f79c-755a-4e22-acf4-413f4b057462.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/mGfkrmIeY6HH1v2lulpSH/120118694943aba6c98e6680d29b1abb/c7d7f79c-755a-4e22-acf4-413f4b057462.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/mGfkrmIeY6HH1v2lulpSH/120118694943aba6c98e6680d29b1abb/c7d7f79c-755a-4e22-acf4-413f4b057462.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/mGfkrmIeY6HH1v2lulpSH/120118694943aba6c98e6680d29b1abb/c7d7f79c-755a-4e22-acf4-413f4b057462.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/mGfkrmIeY6HH1v2lulpSH/120118694943aba6c98e6680d29b1abb/c7d7f79c-755a-4e22-acf4-413f4b057462.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/mGfkrmIeY6HH1v2lulpSH/120118694943aba6c98e6680d29b1abb/c7d7f79c-755a-4e22-acf4-413f4b057462.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/mGfkrmIeY6HH1v2lulpSH/120118694943aba6c98e6680d29b1abb/c7d7f79c-755a-4e22-acf4-413f4b057462.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/mGfkrmIeY6HH1v2lulpSH/120118694943aba6c98e6680d29b1abb/c7d7f79c-755a-4e22-acf4-413f4b057462.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/mGfkrmIeY6HH1v2lulpSH/120118694943aba6c98e6680d29b1abb/c7d7f79c-755a-4e22-acf4-413f4b057462.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/mGfkrmIeY6HH1v2lulpSH/120118694943aba6c98e6680d29b1abb/c7d7f79c-755a-4e22-acf4-413f4b057462.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">\n</p><h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm\" data-testid=\"Text-h3\"><b>全球19个核心市场近一年手游广告变现收入突破110亿美元</b></h3><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">2025下半年至2026上半年，基于 Sensor Tower 纳入广告变现监测的全球19大核心市场统计：手游整体广告变现总收入突破110亿美元，整体平均 eCPM（千次有效展示收益）约51美元。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.020\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.020\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Xyxetrfh76BmyIiFuUB0T/1ccc9c31fc2f719fa28eab883777309b/32906135-72a1-46a3-a4ee-f898a7dd7e0a.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Xyxetrfh76BmyIiFuUB0T/1ccc9c31fc2f719fa28eab883777309b/32906135-72a1-46a3-a4ee-f898a7dd7e0a.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Xyxetrfh76BmyIiFuUB0T/1ccc9c31fc2f719fa28eab883777309b/32906135-72a1-46a3-a4ee-f898a7dd7e0a.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Xyxetrfh76BmyIiFuUB0T/1ccc9c31fc2f719fa28eab883777309b/32906135-72a1-46a3-a4ee-f898a7dd7e0a.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Xyxetrfh76BmyIiFuUB0T/1ccc9c31fc2f719fa28eab883777309b/32906135-72a1-46a3-a4ee-f898a7dd7e0a.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Xyxetrfh76BmyIiFuUB0T/1ccc9c31fc2f719fa28eab883777309b/32906135-72a1-46a3-a4ee-f898a7dd7e0a.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Xyxetrfh76BmyIiFuUB0T/1ccc9c31fc2f719fa28eab883777309b/32906135-72a1-46a3-a4ee-f898a7dd7e0a.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Xyxetrfh76BmyIiFuUB0T/1ccc9c31fc2f719fa28eab883777309b/32906135-72a1-46a3-a4ee-f898a7dd7e0a.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Xyxetrfh76BmyIiFuUB0T/1ccc9c31fc2f719fa28eab883777309b/32906135-72a1-46a3-a4ee-f898a7dd7e0a.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4Xyxetrfh76BmyIiFuUB0T/1ccc9c31fc2f719fa28eab883777309b/32906135-72a1-46a3-a4ee-f898a7dd7e0a.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">AppLovin与AdMob两大广告平台合计包揽手游广告变现总收入的六成以上。分区域来看：美国市场内，AppLovin广告营收份额高达41%；而韩国、印度及东南亚各区域，AdMob广告收入占比均突破40%。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.023\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.023\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6Ub3b3tUpJ4sV1MVxLnRBQ/e0a0180ab3fc1b96459a793f1cb5853e/dd9d3ea4-e764-49b5-920c-69fbb0f1137a.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6Ub3b3tUpJ4sV1MVxLnRBQ/e0a0180ab3fc1b96459a793f1cb5853e/dd9d3ea4-e764-49b5-920c-69fbb0f1137a.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6Ub3b3tUpJ4sV1MVxLnRBQ/e0a0180ab3fc1b96459a793f1cb5853e/dd9d3ea4-e764-49b5-920c-69fbb0f1137a.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6Ub3b3tUpJ4sV1MVxLnRBQ/e0a0180ab3fc1b96459a793f1cb5853e/dd9d3ea4-e764-49b5-920c-69fbb0f1137a.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6Ub3b3tUpJ4sV1MVxLnRBQ/e0a0180ab3fc1b96459a793f1cb5853e/dd9d3ea4-e764-49b5-920c-69fbb0f1137a.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6Ub3b3tUpJ4sV1MVxLnRBQ/e0a0180ab3fc1b96459a793f1cb5853e/dd9d3ea4-e764-49b5-920c-69fbb0f1137a.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6Ub3b3tUpJ4sV1MVxLnRBQ/e0a0180ab3fc1b96459a793f1cb5853e/dd9d3ea4-e764-49b5-920c-69fbb0f1137a.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6Ub3b3tUpJ4sV1MVxLnRBQ/e0a0180ab3fc1b96459a793f1cb5853e/dd9d3ea4-e764-49b5-920c-69fbb0f1137a.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6Ub3b3tUpJ4sV1MVxLnRBQ/e0a0180ab3fc1b96459a793f1cb5853e/dd9d3ea4-e764-49b5-920c-69fbb0f1137a.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6Ub3b3tUpJ4sV1MVxLnRBQ/e0a0180ab3fc1b96459a793f1cb5853e/dd9d3ea4-e764-49b5-920c-69fbb0f1137a.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">2026上半年，在 Sensor Tower 覆盖广告变现数据的全球19个核心市场中，方块解谜超休闲手游《Block Blast!》以1.5亿美元广告收入，位列广告变现冠军，近1年月平均广告变现收入接近2600万美元。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.024\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.024\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/45bq2aboMEayNqiGj2nw9N/754773e4b487ba5039046af7c5d8919b/5bbd1496-c87e-4560-9c35-5fd8cbe5668b.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/45bq2aboMEayNqiGj2nw9N/754773e4b487ba5039046af7c5d8919b/5bbd1496-c87e-4560-9c35-5fd8cbe5668b.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/45bq2aboMEayNqiGj2nw9N/754773e4b487ba5039046af7c5d8919b/5bbd1496-c87e-4560-9c35-5fd8cbe5668b.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/45bq2aboMEayNqiGj2nw9N/754773e4b487ba5039046af7c5d8919b/5bbd1496-c87e-4560-9c35-5fd8cbe5668b.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/45bq2aboMEayNqiGj2nw9N/754773e4b487ba5039046af7c5d8919b/5bbd1496-c87e-4560-9c35-5fd8cbe5668b.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/45bq2aboMEayNqiGj2nw9N/754773e4b487ba5039046af7c5d8919b/5bbd1496-c87e-4560-9c35-5fd8cbe5668b.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/45bq2aboMEayNqiGj2nw9N/754773e4b487ba5039046af7c5d8919b/5bbd1496-c87e-4560-9c35-5fd8cbe5668b.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/45bq2aboMEayNqiGj2nw9N/754773e4b487ba5039046af7c5d8919b/5bbd1496-c87e-4560-9c35-5fd8cbe5668b.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/45bq2aboMEayNqiGj2nw9N/754773e4b487ba5039046af7c5d8919b/5bbd1496-c87e-4560-9c35-5fd8cbe5668b.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/45bq2aboMEayNqiGj2nw9N/754773e4b487ba5039046af7c5d8919b/5bbd1496-c87e-4560-9c35-5fd8cbe5668b.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><br/><h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm\" data-testid=\"Text-h3\"><b>Steam平台买断制游戏销售收入近年快速攀升，平均单次下载收入强势领先</b></h3><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">在全球手游整体营收逐步企稳的大背景下，Steam平台买断制游戏销售收入迎来高速增长：营收规模由2019年的45.5亿美元攀升至2025H2—2026H1统计周期内的107亿美元。平台单次下载平均收益长期稳居高位，近五年均值达14美元，是移动端游戏的9.3倍。以上数据充分印证，跨平台产品对全球玩家始终具备强劲吸引力。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.043\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.043\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6hsyho1NwPSpurC6sdFawO/3b51cc7eb341a716c66916ee04e4b10a/a0ca0bb9-3d3c-44e0-9057-a210c6e0cb32.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6hsyho1NwPSpurC6sdFawO/3b51cc7eb341a716c66916ee04e4b10a/a0ca0bb9-3d3c-44e0-9057-a210c6e0cb32.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6hsyho1NwPSpurC6sdFawO/3b51cc7eb341a716c66916ee04e4b10a/a0ca0bb9-3d3c-44e0-9057-a210c6e0cb32.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6hsyho1NwPSpurC6sdFawO/3b51cc7eb341a716c66916ee04e4b10a/a0ca0bb9-3d3c-44e0-9057-a210c6e0cb32.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6hsyho1NwPSpurC6sdFawO/3b51cc7eb341a716c66916ee04e4b10a/a0ca0bb9-3d3c-44e0-9057-a210c6e0cb32.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6hsyho1NwPSpurC6sdFawO/3b51cc7eb341a716c66916ee04e4b10a/a0ca0bb9-3d3c-44e0-9057-a210c6e0cb32.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6hsyho1NwPSpurC6sdFawO/3b51cc7eb341a716c66916ee04e4b10a/a0ca0bb9-3d3c-44e0-9057-a210c6e0cb32.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6hsyho1NwPSpurC6sdFawO/3b51cc7eb341a716c66916ee04e4b10a/a0ca0bb9-3d3c-44e0-9057-a210c6e0cb32.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6hsyho1NwPSpurC6sdFawO/3b51cc7eb341a716c66916ee04e4b10a/a0ca0bb9-3d3c-44e0-9057-a210c6e0cb32.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6hsyho1NwPSpurC6sdFawO/3b51cc7eb341a716c66916ee04e4b10a/a0ca0bb9-3d3c-44e0-9057-a210c6e0cb32.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><br/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">2026上半年，动作品类牢牢占据 Steam 营收榜首。该品类整体销量虽环比回落7%，但买断营收逆势上行13%，规模升至20.2亿美元，包揽平台总收入的40%。依托一众3A大作带来的付费溢价空间，动作游戏营收实现逆势增长，是Steam最核心的收入基本盘。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.044\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.044\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4OGAd4BfdZALqtTw3V9oyf/303d1ea8370d7297d77e0316bd94bbc5/f6d10307-240a-43ff-aa14-b0afe86c98e4.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4OGAd4BfdZALqtTw3V9oyf/303d1ea8370d7297d77e0316bd94bbc5/f6d10307-240a-43ff-aa14-b0afe86c98e4.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4OGAd4BfdZALqtTw3V9oyf/303d1ea8370d7297d77e0316bd94bbc5/f6d10307-240a-43ff-aa14-b0afe86c98e4.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4OGAd4BfdZALqtTw3V9oyf/303d1ea8370d7297d77e0316bd94bbc5/f6d10307-240a-43ff-aa14-b0afe86c98e4.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4OGAd4BfdZALqtTw3V9oyf/303d1ea8370d7297d77e0316bd94bbc5/f6d10307-240a-43ff-aa14-b0afe86c98e4.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4OGAd4BfdZALqtTw3V9oyf/303d1ea8370d7297d77e0316bd94bbc5/f6d10307-240a-43ff-aa14-b0afe86c98e4.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4OGAd4BfdZALqtTw3V9oyf/303d1ea8370d7297d77e0316bd94bbc5/f6d10307-240a-43ff-aa14-b0afe86c98e4.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4OGAd4BfdZALqtTw3V9oyf/303d1ea8370d7297d77e0316bd94bbc5/f6d10307-240a-43ff-aa14-b0afe86c98e4.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4OGAd4BfdZALqtTw3V9oyf/303d1ea8370d7297d77e0316bd94bbc5/f6d10307-240a-43ff-aa14-b0afe86c98e4.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4OGAd4BfdZALqtTw3V9oyf/303d1ea8370d7297d77e0316bd94bbc5/f6d10307-240a-43ff-aa14-b0afe86c98e4.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\"><b></b></p><h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm\" data-testid=\"Text-h3\"><b>高频率、多层次并行的运营活动体系有效拉升游戏收入与长线留存</b></h3><br/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">2026上半年，海外内购收入排名前八的头部手游，每月平均上线运营活动多达235场；单款游戏月均开设56个不同主题活动，囊括29类活动类别。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.028\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.028\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3hWRPRvMXotfctIAB9H157/17004bf250d1087306fc5a74c67d03eb/14379390-e087-4193-896f-357ab4a1afff.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3hWRPRvMXotfctIAB9H157/17004bf250d1087306fc5a74c67d03eb/14379390-e087-4193-896f-357ab4a1afff.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3hWRPRvMXotfctIAB9H157/17004bf250d1087306fc5a74c67d03eb/14379390-e087-4193-896f-357ab4a1afff.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3hWRPRvMXotfctIAB9H157/17004bf250d1087306fc5a74c67d03eb/14379390-e087-4193-896f-357ab4a1afff.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3hWRPRvMXotfctIAB9H157/17004bf250d1087306fc5a74c67d03eb/14379390-e087-4193-896f-357ab4a1afff.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3hWRPRvMXotfctIAB9H157/17004bf250d1087306fc5a74c67d03eb/14379390-e087-4193-896f-357ab4a1afff.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3hWRPRvMXotfctIAB9H157/17004bf250d1087306fc5a74c67d03eb/14379390-e087-4193-896f-357ab4a1afff.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3hWRPRvMXotfctIAB9H157/17004bf250d1087306fc5a74c67d03eb/14379390-e087-4193-896f-357ab4a1afff.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3hWRPRvMXotfctIAB9H157/17004bf250d1087306fc5a74c67d03eb/14379390-e087-4193-896f-357ab4a1afff.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3hWRPRvMXotfctIAB9H157/17004bf250d1087306fc5a74c67d03eb/14379390-e087-4193-896f-357ab4a1afff.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">多层级、多活动并行的高频运营体系，能够长效拉动游戏流水与用户留存。2026上半年，融合解谜探案、小镇建造双玩法的合成手游《Mystery Town》，ARPDAU达1.3美元，分别为竞品《Merge Mansion》的4.6倍、《Travel Town》的5.2倍。密集多元的运营活动，搭配复合变现架构，是其达成超高变现效率的核心支撑。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">Sensor Tower Playliner 运营活动洞察显示，2026年6月该游戏推出的活动多达237场，包含63款不同名称的活动(一个月内多次上线的相同名称的活动仅统计为1款)。得益于这套高效运营策略，2026年5月《Mystery Town》内购营收逼近1500万美元，规模已超越《Merge Mansion》。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.032\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.032\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2hd4F2xpDzBOj6OGjfqeAk/45e78ce8670eedd5de6fb0401e5a26a3/bfd0cccd-fbc7-4ed0-a8fc-8b536628eb8e.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2hd4F2xpDzBOj6OGjfqeAk/45e78ce8670eedd5de6fb0401e5a26a3/bfd0cccd-fbc7-4ed0-a8fc-8b536628eb8e.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2hd4F2xpDzBOj6OGjfqeAk/45e78ce8670eedd5de6fb0401e5a26a3/bfd0cccd-fbc7-4ed0-a8fc-8b536628eb8e.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2hd4F2xpDzBOj6OGjfqeAk/45e78ce8670eedd5de6fb0401e5a26a3/bfd0cccd-fbc7-4ed0-a8fc-8b536628eb8e.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2hd4F2xpDzBOj6OGjfqeAk/45e78ce8670eedd5de6fb0401e5a26a3/bfd0cccd-fbc7-4ed0-a8fc-8b536628eb8e.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2hd4F2xpDzBOj6OGjfqeAk/45e78ce8670eedd5de6fb0401e5a26a3/bfd0cccd-fbc7-4ed0-a8fc-8b536628eb8e.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2hd4F2xpDzBOj6OGjfqeAk/45e78ce8670eedd5de6fb0401e5a26a3/bfd0cccd-fbc7-4ed0-a8fc-8b536628eb8e.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2hd4F2xpDzBOj6OGjfqeAk/45e78ce8670eedd5de6fb0401e5a26a3/bfd0cccd-fbc7-4ed0-a8fc-8b536628eb8e.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2hd4F2xpDzBOj6OGjfqeAk/45e78ce8670eedd5de6fb0401e5a26a3/bfd0cccd-fbc7-4ed0-a8fc-8b536628eb8e.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2hd4F2xpDzBOj6OGjfqeAk/45e78ce8670eedd5de6fb0401e5a26a3/bfd0cccd-fbc7-4ed0-a8fc-8b536628eb8e.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><br/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">头部游戏持续进行运营活动创新。《Whiteout Survival》全新抽卡活动“Dead Shot”，创新融合带有“策略感”的开箱机制和灵活的倍数投注模式，极大地激发玩家参与度与消费热情，活动收益增幅高达71%。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.037\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.037\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/7nLHFBZtP6M8850KpHcfoT/3d8a24123dd37bbcc8709b62c2776f12/c9427f3a-5608-4edf-8c95-8b732258d977.jpeg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/7nLHFBZtP6M8850KpHcfoT/3d8a24123dd37bbcc8709b62c2776f12/c9427f3a-5608-4edf-8c95-8b732258d977.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/7nLHFBZtP6M8850KpHcfoT/3d8a24123dd37bbcc8709b62c2776f12/c9427f3a-5608-4edf-8c95-8b732258d977.jpeg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/7nLHFBZtP6M8850KpHcfoT/3d8a24123dd37bbcc8709b62c2776f12/c9427f3a-5608-4edf-8c95-8b732258d977.jpeg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/7nLHFBZtP6M8850KpHcfoT/3d8a24123dd37bbcc8709b62c2776f12/c9427f3a-5608-4edf-8c95-8b732258d977.jpeg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/7nLHFBZtP6M8850KpHcfoT/3d8a24123dd37bbcc8709b62c2776f12/c9427f3a-5608-4edf-8c95-8b732258d977.jpeg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/7nLHFBZtP6M8850KpHcfoT/3d8a24123dd37bbcc8709b62c2776f12/c9427f3a-5608-4edf-8c95-8b732258d977.jpeg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/7nLHFBZtP6M8850KpHcfoT/3d8a24123dd37bbcc8709b62c2776f12/c9427f3a-5608-4edf-8c95-8b732258d977.jpeg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/7nLHFBZtP6M8850KpHcfoT/3d8a24123dd37bbcc8709b62c2776f12/c9427f3a-5608-4edf-8c95-8b732258d977.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/7nLHFBZtP6M8850KpHcfoT/3d8a24123dd37bbcc8709b62c2776f12/c9427f3a-5608-4edf-8c95-8b732258d977.jpeg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">《Last War:Survival》推出的“Meteorite Iron War(陨星铁)”活动，在经典锦标赛中进行多维度创新。这款跨服锦标赛使用了“极度时间压缩+免费高频传送+零真实战损”的组合策略，大幅降低玩家参与门槛和战损焦虑，并让SLG游戏具备了电竞比赛的单局爽感。开发团队同时巧妙引入类似《逃离塔科夫》的“高风险战利品掠夺 + 安全箱保底”机制，既保证了重度PvP玩家之间充满张力的“猎杀与夺宝”体验，又通过保底机制保护了普通玩家的参与收益。活动的红黄区”风险隔离设计，通过“收益与风险杠杆”让玩家进行自我筛选，构建了一个极其健康的局内生态。</p><img title=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.038\" alt=\"2026年海外游戏市场洞察.038\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-ro